---
import { CHECKOUT_URL } from '../config';
---

<section class="question" aria-labelledby="question-title">
  <div class="container">
    <blockquote>
      <p>Money takes instructions.<br /><em>Who is giving yours?</em></p>
    </blockquote>
    <p class="question__copy" id="question-title">
      A salary lands. It waits — for a bill, a UPI payment, an EMI, a reward, an emergency,
      a reason. In that short silence, an instruction is written. Not by discipline. By architecture.
    </p>
    <div class="question__cta" style="margin-top: 2.2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--ghost-dark" href={CHECKOUT_URL}>
        See how the rule works <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>